date: 2025-11-04T00:00:00-04:00
---

The Stepwell is a radial interchange at the geographic center of [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]], and the transport hub of the city. Trains from the Stepwell run to other parts of [[Geography/Calaria/index|Calaria]], to [[Geography/Brithwyn/index|Brithwyn]], and to other parts of the continent, and the local tram lines converge there. The roads that carry traffic between districts pass through it as well. [[Org/Prime Meridian/index|Prime Meridian]] manages the interchange and charges a toll on anyone crossing between districts; holding a license covers it. The ways in and out double and twist back on one another, and knowing the route without reading the signs is a point of pride for people born in the city.
